d-wpvy4v7s></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"6\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s></div><nav class=\"mobile-nav\" id=\"site-mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Mobile\" hidden data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s><a href=\"/\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>Home</a><a href=\"/features/\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>Features</a><a href=\"/install/\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>Install</a><a href=\"/faq/\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>FAQ</a><a href=\"/blog/\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>Blog</a><a href=\"https://github.com/nikzlabs/shipit\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-wpvy4v7s>GitHub</a></nav></header><script type=\"module\">var e=document.getElementById(`site-nav-toggle`),t=document.getElementById(`site-mobile-nav`);e&&t&&(e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(!n)),n?t.setAttribute(`hidden`,``):t.removeAttribute(`hidden`)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(n=>n.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),t.setAttribute(`hidden`,``)})));</script><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\">\n  \n  <div class=\"bp\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- ===================== HERO ===================== --><section class=\"hero container-page\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"hero-frame\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"hero-grid\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- Left: copy --><div class=\"hero-copy\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"badge\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"live\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>Open source &middot; Apache 2.0</span><h1 class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Run coding agents through <span class=\"sig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>your real engineering loop</span></h1><p class=\"sub\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>A self-hosted, chat-driven IDE for Claude Code and Codex \u2014 the whole loop, from running app to merged PR, in one place.</p><div class=\"cta-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#install\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Get started <span class=\"arrow\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u2192</span></a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://github.com/nikzlabs/shipit\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d=\"M12 .5A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 .5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.7-3.88-1.36-3.88-1.36-.52-1.32-1.27-1.68-1.27-1.68-1.04-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.15.08 1.76 1.18 1.76 1.18 1.02 1.75 2.68 1.24 3.34.95.1-.74.4-1.24.73-1.53-2.55-.29-5.23-1.28-5.23-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.18-3.08-.12-.29-.51-1.46.11-3.04 0 0 .96-.31 3.16 1.18.92-.26 1.9-.39 2.88-.39s1.96.13 2.88.39c2.2-1.49 3.16-1.18 3.16-1.18.62 1.58.23 2.75.11 3.04.73.8 1.18 1.82 1.18 3.08 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.25 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.13v3.16c0 .31.21.68.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 23.5 12 11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg><span class=\"gh-full\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>View on GitHub</span><span class=\"gh-short\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>GitHub</span></a></div><div class=\"spec-note\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><i class=\"dot\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i>Docker &middot; self-hosted</span><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><i class=\"dot\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i>Claude Code / Codex</span><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><i class=\"dot\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i>Running app \u2192 merged PR</span></div></div><!-- Right: the engineering loop, framed as FIG. 1. The static mockup\n               drew a schematic here; we keep the live orbital animation instead. --><figure class=\"schematic\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><figcaption class=\"fig-cap\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FIG. 1 \u2014 THE ENGINEERING LOOP</span></figcaption><div class=\"loop-stage\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"engine-loop\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><main class=\"stage\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ShipIt: a glowing commit packet travels an orbital engineering loop \u2014 Build, Verify, Preview, PR, CI, Merge, Deploy. The agent writes code, verifies it against a real running copy of the app by screenshotting and iterating, then the user previews the live web app; only after that does the pull request get checked, merged, and deployed. The orbit folds into an inline panel showing the preview reviewed, CI passed, pull request merged, and deploy live. Ends on the ShipIt wordmark and the line: your real engineering loop, inline.\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"ambient\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></div><div class=\"floor\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></div><!-- ===== Orbital system ===== --><div class=\"system\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><!-- SVG orbital track --><svg class=\"orbit-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><defs data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><linearGradient id=\"trackGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f794a8\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></stop><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#e43a5b\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#f0506e\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></stop></linearGradient></defs><!-- base ring --><circle class=\"track-base\" cx=\"500\" cy=\"500\" r=\"380\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle><!-- progress arc, rotated so 0% begins at top (12 o'clock) --><circle class=\"track-prog\" cx=\"500\" cy=\"500\" r=\"380\" transform=\"rotate(-90 500 500)\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle><!-- node anchor rings (7 evenly spaced, match the HTML node labels) --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"500.0\" cy=\"120.0\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- Build --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"797.1\" cy=\"263.1\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- Verify --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"870.5\" cy=\"584.6\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- Preview --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"664.9\" cy=\"842.4\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- PR --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"335.1\" cy=\"842.4\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- CI --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"129.5\" cy=\"584.6\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- Merge --><circle class=\"node-ring\" cx=\"202.9\" cy=\"263.1\" r=\"7\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle>  <!-- Deploy --></svg><!-- Glow-trail canvas (packet + comet tail) --><canvas id=\"trail\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></canvas><!-- HTML node labels around the orbit.\n           7 nodes at angles -90, -90+360/7*k. --tx/--ty place them on a\n           circle of radius 30cqmin (\u2248 the SVG r=380 in a 64cqmin box).\n           Each --delay offsets the dot/label pulse so activation chases\n           the packet (packet sweeps 7%..72% \u2192 one node every ~9.3%). --><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: 0cqmin;        --ty: -24.32cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.070);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.070);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Build</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: 19.01cqmin;   --ty: -15.16cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.163);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.163);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Verify</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: 23.71cqmin;   --ty: 5.41cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.256);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.256);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Preview</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: 10.55cqmin;   --ty: 21.91cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.349);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.349);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>PR</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: -10.55cqmin;  --ty: 21.91cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.441);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.441);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>CI</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: -23.71cqmin;  --ty: 5.41cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.534);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.534);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Merge</span></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"--tx: -19.01cqmin;  --ty: -15.16cqmin;\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dot\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.627);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"lbl\" style=\"animation-delay: calc(var(--loop) *  0.627);\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Deploy</span></div><!-- Packet payload card: morphs to match the node the packet passes --><div class=\"payload\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"card\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"bar\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"d v\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"d\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"d\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"ttl\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>commit \u00b7 a1f9c2e</span></div><div class=\"body\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"scenes\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><!-- BUILD \u2014 the agent actually writing the code --><div class=\"scene s0\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Build \u00b7 writing code</div><div class=\"mono\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>edit</span> limiter.ts <span class=\"add\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>+13</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>edit</span> window.ts <span class=\"add\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>+21</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>edit</span> config.ts <span class=\"add\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>+4</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"grn\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2713 3 files \u00b7 +38</span></div></div><!-- VERIFY \u2014 the agent's own feedback loop against a real running copy --><div class=\"scene s1\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Verify \u00b7 self-check</div><div class=\"verify\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"shot\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"b\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"l\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span><span class=\"cap\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span></span><span class=\"vlog\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u21bb screenshot</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>nudge \u2192 fix</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"grn\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2713 matches \u00d72</span></span></div></div><!-- PREVIEW \u2014 the user previews the real running web app (sample To-Do app) --><div class=\"scene s2\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Preview \u00b7 live app</div><div class=\"webprev\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"wbar\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><i data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></i><i data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></i><i data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></i><span class=\"url\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>localhost:4123</span></div><div class=\"wbody\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"apptitle\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Todos</div><div class=\"todo done\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"box\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2713</span> Write tests</div><div class=\"todo done\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"box\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2713</span> Add rate limit</div><div class=\"todo fresh\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"box\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span> Ship release</div><div class=\"addbar\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"ph\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Add a task\u2026</span><span class=\"addbtn\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>+</span></div></div></div></div><!-- PR --><div class=\"scene s3\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Pull request</div><div class=\"mono\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span style=\"color:var(--violet-3)\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>#214</span> Add rate limiter<br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>feat/limiter \u2192 main</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>+38 \u00b7 3 files</span></div></div><!-- CI --><div class=\"scene s4\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 CI \u00b7 checks</div><div class=\"cibar c1\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span></div><div class=\"cibar c2\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span></div><div class=\"cibar c3\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></span></div><div class=\"mono grn\" style=\"font-size:9px\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>lint \u00b7 tests \u00b7 typecheck</div></div><!-- MERGE --><div class=\"scene s5\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Merge</div><div class=\"mono\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span style=\"color:var(--violet-3)\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>#214</span> \u2192 main<br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>squash \u00b7 1 commit</span><br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"grn\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2713 merged</span></div></div><!-- DEPLOY (after merge) --><div class=\"scene s6\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"head\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u25b8 Deploy</div><div class=\"deploy\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"ring\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><i data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></i></span><span class=\"mono grn\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>deployed \u00b7 v1.4<br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"dim\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>live \u00b7 healthy</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- /system --><!-- Inline GitHub-style panel the orbit folds into (climax) --><div class=\"inline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"ghcard\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"ghbar\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/favicon.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"nm\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Ship<b data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>It</b></span><span class=\"crumb\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u00b7 feat/limiter</span><span class=\"merged\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>MERGED</span></div><div class=\"ghbody\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"prtitle\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>#214 \u00b7 Add request rate limiter</div><div class=\"prmeta\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>feat/limiter \u2192 main \u00b7 +38 \u00b7 3 files</div><div class=\"steprow s1\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><path d=\"M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></circle></svg><span class=\"t\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Preview</span><span class=\"s\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>reviewed live</span></div><div class=\"steprow s2\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></path></svg><span class=\"t\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>CI</span><span class=\"s\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>3 checks passed</span></div><div class=\"steprow s3\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></path></svg><span class=\"t\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Pull request</span><span class=\"s\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>merged to main</span></div><div class=\"steprow s4\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></path></svg><span class=\"t\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Deploy</span><span class=\"s\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>live \u00b7 healthy</span></div></div></div></div><!-- Early hook \u2014 the highlighted stage chases the packet around the loop --><div class=\"hook\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"w s0\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Build</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s1\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Verify</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s2\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Preview</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s3\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>PR</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s4\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>CI</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s5\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Merge</span> <span class=\"arr\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>\u2192</span> <span class=\"w s6\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Deploy</span></div><!-- Thesis punchline on its own line: hidden during the chase, fades in a\n         beat after Deploy lights, then drifts slowly up and grows as the orbit\n         folds away \u2014 gathering the eye on the payoff as the loop closes. --><div class=\"punch\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>All inline</div><!-- Climax lockup --><div class=\"lockup\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><div class=\"wordmark\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l><span class=\"logo-mark\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>S</span><span class=\"logo-word\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Ship<b data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>It</b></span></div><div class=\"tagline\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Your real engineering loop.<br data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Inline.</div><div class=\"subline\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>Build, preview, merge, deploy \u2014 the <span class=\"accent\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l>whole loop</span>, without leaving ShipIt.</div></div><div class=\"vignette\" data-astro-cid-lht25p7l></div></main></div><script type=\"module\">(function(){if(window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia(`(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`).matches)return;var e=document.getElementById(`trail`),t=e.getContext(`2d`),n=0,r=0,i=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);function a(){n=e.clientWidth,r=e.clientHeight,e.width=n*i,e.height=r*i,t.setTransform(i,0,0,i,0,0)}window.addEventListener(`resize`,a),a();var o=16e3,s=.07,c=.72,l=[],u=26,d=performance.now(),f=!1,p=document.querySelector(`.track-prog`);function m(e){if(p&&p.getAnimations){var t=p.getAnimations()[0];if(t&&t.currentTime!=null){var n=typeof t.currentTime==`number`?t.currentTime:t.currentTime.value;if(n!=null)return n%o/o}}return(e-d)%o/o}function h(e){var t=-Math.PI/2+e*Math.PI*2,i=n/2,a=r/2,o=Math.min(n,r)*.5*.76;return{x:i+Math.cos(t)*o,y:a+Math.sin(t)*o}}function g(e){var i=m(e);if(!(i>=s&&i<=c)){f&&(t.clearRect(0,0,n,r),l.length=0),f=!1,requestAnimationFrame(g);return}f=!0;var a=(i-s)/(c-s);a<0&&(a=0),a>1&&(a=1);var o=h(a);l.push(o),l.length>u&&l.shift(),t.clearRect(0,0,n,r),t.globalCompositeOperation=`lighter`;for(var d=0;d<l.length;d++){var p=d/l.length,_=l[d],v=p*p*.5,y=1.5+p*4.5;t.beginPath(),t.fillStyle=`rgba(255,200,110,`+v+`)`,t.shadowColor=`rgba(255,220,150,0.9)`,t.shadowBlur=10*p,t.arc(_.x,_.y,y,0,Math.PI*2),t.fill()}t.shadowColor=`rgba(255,225,160,1)`,t.shadowBlur=26,t.beginPath(),t.fillStyle=`rgba(255,210,122,0.95)`,t.arc(o.x,o.y,6.5,0,Math.PI*2),t.fill(),t.shadowBlur=0,t.beginPath(),t.fillStyle=`rgba(255,255,255,0.95)`,t.arc(o.x,o.y,2.6,0,Math.PI*2),t.fill(),t.globalCompositeOperation=`source-over`,t.globalAlpha=1,requestAnimationFrame(g)}requestAnimationFrame(g)})();</script></div></figure></div></div></section><!-- ===================== THESIS / WHY ===================== --><section class=\"band container-page\" id=\"why\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"thesis\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"thesis-head\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FIG. 2 \u2014 WHY SHIPIT EXISTS</span><p class=\"eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>The premise</p></div><h2 class=\"thesis-title\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Coding agents are the <span class=\"sig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>easy part</span></h2><p class=\"thesis-body\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>You already have Claude Code or Codex. The hard part is everything around them \u2014 the isolated environment, the running app to test against, the parallel branches that never collide, the whole PR&nbsp;\u2192&nbsp;CI&nbsp;\u2192&nbsp;deploy&nbsp;\u2192&nbsp;review loop. ShipIt is the surface that ties it all together, so you build, review, and ship in one place instead of stitching it together yourself.</p></div></section><!-- ===================== CAPABILITIES ===================== --><section class=\"band container-page\" id=\"features\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"sec-head\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"head-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FIG. 3 \u2014 CAPABILITY SCHEDULE</span><p class=\"eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>What you get</p></div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Everything the agent needs to ship real software</h2><div class=\"underrule\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></div></div><div class=\"caps\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><i class=\"crop tl\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i><i class=\"crop tr\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i><i class=\"crop bl\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i><i class=\"crop br\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></i><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a701</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"9\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M6 15 H42\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"0.9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"0.9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M19 43 H29\"/><path d=\"M24 35 V43\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"25\" r=\"6\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/><path d=\"M24 22 V25 L26 27\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Real app feedback</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Every session runs its own instance of your full app stack, so the agent can build, run, and fix before you preview and merge.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>PER-SESSION STACK</span></div><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a702</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"13\" y=\"14\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#f0506e\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"28.5\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#f0506e\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M19 28 H29\"/><path d=\"M24 14 V9\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M13 21 H8 M35 21 H40\"/><path d=\"M16 32 L13 38 M32 32 L35 38\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Bring your own agent</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Claude Code or Codex, on the subscription or API key you already have. Connect several accounts and ShipIt rolls to the next before a usage limit stops you.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>AGENT-AGNOSTIC</span></div><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a703</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"18\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/><path d=\"M11 16 H21 M11 20 H18 M27 24 H37 M27 28 H34\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Parallel &amp; isolated</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Many agents at once, each in its own sandboxed container, branch, and workspace \u2014 concurrent work that never collides.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>SANDBOXED \u00b7 N-UP</span></div><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a704</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"11\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#f0506e\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"32\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#f0506e\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M21 16 H33 M21 32 H33\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Self-hosted</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>On an always-on server you own, or local on your laptop. Docker end to end, so previews and follow-up work keep running after you close the lid.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>DOCKER \u00b7 ALWAYS-ON</span></div><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a705</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"35\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3.4\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/><path d=\"M14 16.4 V31.6\"/><path d=\"M14 16.4 C14 24 22 24 30.6 24\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>The GitHub loop, inline</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Work with PRs, CI, deploys, reviews, and issues without leaving ShipIt \u2014 branches, checks, and merge state render right in chat.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>PR \u00b7 CI \u00b7 DEPLOY</span></div><div class=\"cap-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a706</span><div class=\"glyph\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M21 37 H27\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/><path d=\"M19 21 C19 26 29 26 29 21\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/><path d=\"M24 26 V29\" stroke=\"#f0506e\"/></svg></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Ship from your phone</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Mobile-first, with first-class voice. Dictate prompts and hear spoken summaries when the agent finishes a turn or needs you.</p><span class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"tick\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class=\"seg\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span>MOBILE-FIRST \u00b7 VOICE</span></div></div></section><!-- ===================== INSTALL ===================== --><section class=\"band container-page\" id=\"install\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"sec-head\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"head-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FIG. 4 \u2014 DEPLOYMENT PROCEDURE</span><p class=\"eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Install</p></div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Run it locally, then host it for real</h2><div class=\"underrule\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></div></div><div class=\"install-wrap install-steps\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- Step 01 \u2014 kick the tires locally. --><div class=\"step\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"step-head\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"step-no\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>01</span><div class=\"step-text\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Try it on your laptop</b><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>One command, local Docker</span></div></div><div class=\"terminal\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"tbar\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a7INSTALL &middot; LOCAL DOCKER</span><span class=\"meta\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>TARGET \u2192 http://localhost:4123</span></div><div class=\"tbody\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><button class=\"copy-btn copy\" data-copy-target=\"installCmd\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg class=\"copy-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg><span class=\"copy-label\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Copy</span></button><div class=\"code\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"gutter\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>01</div><div class=\"cmd\" id=\"installCmd\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"prompt\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>$ </span><code data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>bash</span> &lt;(<span class=\"fn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>curl</span> <span class=\"fl\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>-fsSL</span> <span class=\"url\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nikzlabs/shipit/stable/deployment/local/setup.sh</span>)</code></div></div></div></div><div class=\"req-table\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"rt\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"k\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Runtime</div><div class=\"v\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Docker <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>+ Compose v2</span></div></div><div class=\"rt\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"k\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Credentials</div><div class=\"v\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Claude / Codex <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>sub or API key</span></div></div></div></div><!-- Step 02 \u2014 the intended home: an always-on VPS. Visually promoted. --><div class=\"step\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"step-head\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"step-no\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>02</span><div class=\"step-text\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Then host it always-on</b><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Where ShipIt is meant to live</span></div><span class=\"rec-pill\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Recommended</span></div><div class=\"terminal is-rec\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"tbar\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"pn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u00a7DEPLOY &middot; ALWAYS-ON VPS</span><span class=\"meta\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>UBUNTU HOST \u00b7 ROOT</span></div><div class=\"tbody\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><button class=\"copy-btn copy\" data-copy-target=\"vpsCmd\" aria-label=\"Copy VPS provisioning command\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg class=\"copy-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg><span class=\"copy-label\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Copy</span></button><div class=\"code stacked\" id=\"vpsCmd\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"gnum\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>01</span><div class=\"cmd\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"prompt\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>$ </span><code data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>ssh</span> root@<span class=\"fl\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>&lt;server-ip&gt;</span></code></div></div><div class=\"row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"gnum\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>02</span><div class=\"cmd\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"prompt\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>$ </span><code data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class=\"fn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>sudo</span> bash -c \"$(<span class=\"fn\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>curl</span> <span class=\"fl\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>-fsSL</span> <span class=\"url\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nikzlabs/shipit/stable/deployment/vps/setup.sh</span>)\"</code></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"install-note\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Stays up when your laptop is closed.</b> The provisioner installs Docker, tunes host limits, and optionally wires <span class=\"req\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Cloudflare Tunnel</span>&#32; and <span class=\"req\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Tailscale</span> \u2014 no open inbound ports.&#32;<a href=\"/install/#vps\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>See the VPS guide \u2192</a></p></div></div></section><!-- ===================== CLOSING CTA ===================== --><section class=\"band container-page\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"closing\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class=\"echo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></div><span class=\"fig\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FIG. 5 \u2014 THE CLOSED LOOP</span><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>The build, review, ship, and debug loop stays in the <span class=\"live-t\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>conversation</span></h2><div class=\"cta-row\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#install\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Get started <span class=\"arrow\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>\u2192</span></a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/features/\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>See all features</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://github.com/nikzlabs/shipit\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d=\"M12 .5A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 .5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.7-3.88-1.36-3.88-1.36-.52-1.32-1.27-1.68-1.27-1.68-1.04-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.15.08 1.76 1.18 1.76 1.18 1.02 1.75 2.68 1.24 3.34.95.1-.74.4-1.24.73-1.53-2.55-.29-5.23-1.28-5.23-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.18-3.08-.12-.29-.51-1.46.11-3.04 0 0 .96-.31 3.16 1.18.92-.26 1.9-.39 2.88-.39s1.96.13 2.88.39c2.2-1.49 3.16-1.18 3.16-1.18.62 1.58.23 2.75.11 3.04.73.8 1.18 1.82 1.18 3.08 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.25 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.13v3.16c0 .31.21.68.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 23.5 12 11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg>View on GitHub</a></div></div></section><script type=\"module\">document.querySelectorAll(`.copy-btn`).forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener(`click`,async()=>{let t=e.getAttribute(`data-copy-text`),n;if(t)n=t;else{let t=e.getAttribute(`data-copy-target`);if(!t)return;let r=document.getElementById(t)?.querySelectorAll(`code`);if(!r||r.length===0)return;n=Array.from(r).map(e=>e.textContent??``).join(`\n`)}try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(n)}catch{let e=document.createElement(`textarea`);e.value=n,e.style.position=`f